'''Snow Dagger''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] that was obtainable by unboxing the [[2025 Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2025]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has ended.

== Appearance ==
Snow Dagger takes on a traditional small dagger-like shape with snowy colors, hence the name. The pommel is light blue in color with a white handle attached to it. The guard has a V-shape and is light blue in color. Above the guard, on the bottom of the blade, is a screw with a light blue tint. The blade itself is short, being rounded at the tip.

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the godly gun [[Snowcannon]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Snow Set|Snow Set]].
* It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Snow Dagger]].

